            %img{:src => "/nlab/files/GeomPhys-FirstIdeaFluxQuantization-240123.jpg", :width => "450px"}/
          %p
            The admissible flux quantization laws for a higher gauge theory with Bianchi-Gauss
            = succeed "-algebra" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
