              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D-brane+charge+quantization+in+topological+K-theory"} D-brane charge quantization in topological K-theory
              it follows (an algebro-topological form of “
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/gauge+enhancement"}> gauge enhancement
              ”) that gauge potentials with coefficients in
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi 𝔰𝔲
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi n
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathfrak{su}(n)
              (namely
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/connection+on+a+bundle"} connections
              on Hermitean
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/vector+bundles"} vector bundles
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cocycles"} cocycles
              for the resulting
              = succeed "." do
