              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo ⇝
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \rightsquigarrow
              K-theory
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo ⇝
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \rightsquigarrow
              gauge bundles as cocycles) that non-abelian
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/gauge+fields"} gauge fields
              appear on
