            %p
              In fact, flux quantization as discussed here does not apply to
              = succeed "-" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/su%28n%29"}
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi 𝔰𝔲
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                        %mi n
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathfrak{su}(n)
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Yang-Mills+theory"} Yang-Mills theory
              directly:
            %p
              Generally, not all
