          %h2#FluxDensitiesAndBraneSources Flux densities and Brane charges
          %h3#OrdinaryElectromagneticFluxAndItsBranes Electromagnetic flux and its “branes”
          %p
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Faraday"} Faraday
