          %p
            The resulting
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dgc-algebra"} differential graded-commutative (dgc) algebra
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
