          %p
            we can use
            %em verbatim
            the same construction:
          %p
            A degree=1 derivation on
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msup
