                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \wedge^\bullet\mathfrak{g}^\vee
            is determined by its restriction to
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
