          %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:FinTypeLInfinityAlgebrasAsDGCAlgebras"} (18)
          it is the
          %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chevalley-Eilenberg+algebra"} Chevalley-Eilenberg algebra
          of an
          %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/L-infinity+algebra"}
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}>
