              %mrow
                %mi 𝔩
                %mi 𝒜
              %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathfrak{l}\mathcal{A}
          (essentially the “Quillen model”): The
          %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Whitehead+bracket"} Whitehead bracket
          algebra structure on the
          = succeed "-rational" do
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi ℝ
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{R}
          %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+groups"} homotopy groups
          of the
          %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/loop+space"} loop space
          #eq:WhiteheadLInfinityAlgebra.maruku-equation
            %span.maruku-eq-number (22)
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
