                  %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace", :rspace => "0em"} −
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathfrak{l}(-)
            ” as standing for “Lie” or for “loops”.)
          %p
            Some examples for how to use Prop.
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#SullivanTheorem"}
            to compute
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sullivan+models"} Sullivan models
            and hence
            = succeed "-" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
