                  %mspace{:width => "thinmathspace"}
                  %mi X
                  %mo →
                  %mi Y
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} f \,\colon\, X \to Y
            should “count as” an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/invertible+morphism"} invertible
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/isomorphism"} isomorphism
            (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/diffeomorphism"} diffeomorphism
            of smooth sets) already if it is a
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/local+isomorphism"} local isomorphism
            in that its transformation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi f
                    %mo *
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} f_\ast
            of plots is a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/bijection"} bijection
            (not necessarily on all plots but) between
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/germs"} germs
            of plots (around
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
