                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathrm{U}(1)
              %br/
              For a long time, these examples
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#HigherCircleGaugePotentials"}
              used to be the state of the art in understanding flux quantization of higher gauge fields. But notice that in all three items the flux-quantization of the duality-partner fields (and hence of the
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/canonical+momenta"} canonical momenta
